    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget the rules, master the physics, and brace yourself for a pure adrenaline rush! <strong>Twin Trials</strong> is a frantic arcade FPS where every move counts, and every broken score shapes your destiny.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take control of a unique arsenal, and make the sky your arena</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Airsunder</strong>, powerful and unpredictable, is your best ally for <strong>explosive rocket jumps</strong>, launching your character to unreachable heights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Cycler</strong>, precise and sharp, becomes a subtle propeller, letting you <strong>glide with agility</strong> through perilous courses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique challenges to forge your story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of <strong>Twin Trials</strong> is a vast playground scattered with challenges designed to push your limits. <strong>Explore 15 intense trials</strong>, each delivering a radically different experience:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platforming</strong>: Leap through suspended courses where the ground is an illusion and every misstep means a fatal fall. Deadly traps and hostile environments turn every jump into a battle for survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision</strong>: Aim fast, aim true. Test your skills by blasting moving targets. Victory favors those who leave no room for error.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Attack</strong>: Dive into frantic races where every second counts to set the best time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival</strong>: Face relentless waves of obstacles and enemies, using every mechanic at your disposal to stay alive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026 and many more wild challenges await!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Old-school at heart, new-school in the nerves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ultimate goal? Glory. Achieve unmatched scores, chain spectacular combos, and climb online leaderboards to prove your supremacy. The competition is fierce, but the reward is unrivaled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Twin Trials</i>: arcade reinvented. Your legend begins here.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget the rules, master the physics, and brace yourself for a pure adrenaline rush! <strong>Twin Trials</strong> is a frantic arcade FPS where every move counts, and every broken score shapes your destiny.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take control of a unique arsenal, and make the sky your arena</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Airsunder</strong>, powerful and unpredictable, is your best ally for <strong>explosive rocket jumps</strong>, launching your character to unreachable heights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Cycler</strong>, precise and sharp, becomes a subtle propeller, letting you <strong>glide with agility</strong> through perilous courses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique challenges to forge your story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of <strong>Twin Trials</strong> is a vast playground scattered with challenges designed to push your limits. <strong>Explore 15 intense trials</strong>, each delivering a radically different experience:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platforming</strong>: Leap through suspended courses where the ground is an illusion and every misstep means a fatal fall. Deadly traps and hostile environments turn every jump into a battle for survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision</strong>: Aim fast, aim true. Test your skills by blasting moving targets. Victory favors those who leave no room for error.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Attack</strong>: Dive into frantic races where every second counts to set the best time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival</strong>: Face relentless waves of obstacles and enemies, using every mechanic at your disposal to stay alive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026 and many more wild challenges await!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Old-school at heart, new-school in the nerves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ultimate goal? Glory. Achieve unmatched scores, chain spectacular combos, and climb online leaderboards to prove your supremacy. The competition is fierce, but the reward is unrivaled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Twin Trials</i>: arcade reinvented. Your legend begins here.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Dive into Twin Trials, a dynamic arcade FPS featuring an innovative system where you wield up to two weapons simultaneously to interact with physics and the environment. With varied challenges and explosive gameplay, will you manage to dominate the global leaderboards?",
